  m_Name: Fan_Blades
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Fan Blades
  description: The Fan Blades are small, thin-flat components positioned at the middle-center-rear
    of the jet engine, constructed from Front fan material, responsible for drawing
    in large volumes of air and directing it towards the engine's core. Their unique
    shape and strategic placement enable the engine to achieve remarkable efficiency
    and performance. Notably, the Fan Blades are designed to be highly resistant
    to fatigue and stress, allowing them to withstand the intense forces generated
    during engine operation and maintain optimal performance over time.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 066b6dd1107e28c409953565df7e933d, type: 3}
